   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## [1,0] Solver Trace\n\nDeterministic compiled-row diagnostics for the known `[1,0]` excited-spin-field probe sample.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "probeTrace1 = Module[{o, model, family, candidate, lhsAssoc},\n  o = Private`getOutgoingOperatorsTensors[\n    {\n      R[S[{a1, \"antichiral\"}, -1/2, {{mu, -1}}, 0, z1]],\n      R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z2], \\[Psi][nu, 0, z2]]\n    },\n    1,\n    0,\n    1234\n  ];\n  model = Private`compileSpinProjectionSectorModel[\"Holo\", o[\"holoOps\"], 1, o[\"holoData\"]];\n  family = First[model[\"Families\"]];\n  candidate = {Developer`ToPackedArray[{10}], Developer`ToPackedArray[{4, 7}]};\n  lhsAssoc = Private`spinProjectionOperatorAssociation @ Expand @ Private`spinProjectionSectorEvaluation[\n    \"Holo\",\n    1,\n    Bosonize /@ {\n      R[S[{{1/2, -1/2, 1/2, -1/2, -1/2}, \"antichiral\"}, -1/2, {{4, -1}}, 0, z1]],\n      R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z2], \\[Psi][7, 0, z2]]\n    }\n  ];\n  <|\n    \"LHSAssoc\" -> lhsAssoc,\n    \"Trace\" -> Private`spinProjectionCandidateRowsTrace[model, candidate, <|\"Rows\" -> {}, \"Pivots\" -> {}|>, 1234],\n    \"Exhaustive\" -> Private`spinProjectionExhaustiveFamilyRows[model, family, candidate]\n  |>\n];\n\ntest5 = testReport[\n  \"Probe Test 5 ([1,0] solver trace diagnostics run)\",\n  AssociationQ[probeTrace1] &&\n    AssociationQ[probeTrace1[\"LHSAssoc\"]] &&\n    AssociationQ[probeTrace1[\"Trace\"]] &&\n    AssociationQ[probeTrace1[\"Exhaustive\"]] &&\n    Length[probeTrace1[\"Trace\", \"Families\"]] == 1\n];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Mixed Gamma Regression\n\nDeterministic checks for the corrected mixed `DU/UD` and `UD/DU` antisymmetrized gamma semantics, plus the fixed `[1,0]` bad sample.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "mixedGammaRegression1 = Module[{actual, expected},\n  actual = Normal @ Private`spinProjectionGammaFactorMatrix[{GammaDUHold[4], GammaUDHold[7]}];\n  expected = Normal @ (1/2 (GammaDUSparse[4].GammaUDSparse[7] - GammaDUSparse[7].GammaUDSparse[4]));\n  AllTrue[Flatten[Simplify[actual - expected]], PossibleZeroQ]\n];\n\nmixedGammaRegression2 = Module[{actual, expected},\n  actual = Normal @ Private`spinProjectionGammaFactorMatrix[{GammaUDHold[4], GammaDUHold[7]}];\n  expected = Normal @ (1/2 (GammaUDSparse[4].GammaDUSparse[7] - GammaUDSparse[7].GammaDUSparse[4]));\n  AllTrue[Flatten[Simplify[actual - expected]], PossibleZeroQ]\n];\n\nprobeFixed1 = Module[{rhs, assoc, outputData, outputState, key},\n  rhs = OPEProjected[1, 0][R[S[{a1, \"antichiral\"}, -1/2, {{mu, -1}}, 0, z1]], R[exp\\[Phi]f[-1, z2], \\[Psi][nu, 0, z2]], \"RandomSeed\" -> 1234];\n  outputData = <|\"Head\" -> S, \"Index\" -> α1, \"Chirality\" -> \"antichiral\", \"Picture\" -> -3/2, \"Modes\" -> {}, \"Level\" -> 0, \"z\" -> 0|>;\n  outputState = {1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, -1/2};\n  key = R[expH[{-3/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, 1/2, -1/2}, 0]];\n  assoc = Private`spinProjectionOperatorAssociation @ probeEvaluateConcreteProjectedRHS[\n    rhs,\n    {mu -> 4, nu -> 7, a1 -> {1/2, -1/2, 1/2, -1/2, -1/2}},\n    outputData,\n    outputState\n  ];\n  <|\"RHS\" -> rhs, \"Assoc\" -> assoc, \"Coeff\" -> Lookup[assoc, key, 0]|>\n];\n\ntest6 = testReport[\n  \"Probe Test 6 (mixed rank-2 gamma antisymmetrization keeps U/D pattern)\",\n  mixedGammaRegression1 && mixedGammaRegression2\n];\n\ntest7 = testReport[\n  \"Probe Test 7 ([1,0] fixed bad sample now reproduces missing coefficient)\",\n  Simplify[probeFixed1[\"Coeff\"] - 1/(2 (z1 - z2)^2)] === 0\n];\n\ntest8 = testReport[\n  \"Probe Test 8 ([1,0] bad sample now yields nonzero compiled rows)\",\n  probeTrace1[\"Trace\", \"Families\"][[1, \"NonzeroStateRows\"]] =!= <||> &&\n    probeTrace1[\"Exhaustive\", \"StateRows\"] =!= <||>\n];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Five-Spin Samples\n\nConcrete bosonized checks for the projected `S-S-S-S-S` OPE with random external spinor states.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "probeSample5 = probeProjectedMultiSpinOPESamples[\n  \"Holo\",\n  0,\n  OPEProjected[0, 0][\n    R[S[{a1, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z1]],\n    R[S[{a2, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z2]],\n    R[S[{a3, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z3]],\n    R[S[{a4, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z4]],\n    R[S[{a5, \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z5]],\n    \"RandomSeed\" -> 1234\n  ],\n  {},\n  {{a1, \"chiral\"}, {a2, \"chiral\"}, {a3, \"chiral\"}, {a4, \"chiral\"}, {a5, \"chiral\"}},\n  Function[{vecs, spins}, {\n    R[S[{spins[a1], \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z1]],\n    R[S[{spins[a2], \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z2]],\n    R[S[{spins[a3], \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z3]],\n    R[S[{spins[a4], \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z4]],\n    R[S[{spins[a5], \"chiral\"}, -1/2, {}, 0, z5]]\n  }],\n  5,\n  120,\n  20260411\n];\n\ntest9 = testReport[\"Probe Test 9 (five-spin concrete probes all match)\", probeSample5[\"PassQ\"]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {},
   "executionSummary": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "probeSample5",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
